      "writtenOn": "2017-12-20T03:30:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we doing this? d_fsdata is only written to when we allocate it, and then when it is removed. So long as the deletion is done in a RCU friendly way, I don\u0027t why we need this here, and in SDCARDFS_DI_R/SDCARDFS_DI_W",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 309,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 314,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "9d6251bd6b7e4e69d43f9ace4fd3a3b6e1dcbeec",
